    "locale": "en",
    "translations": {
      "diagram.description.architecture": "Every write goes one of four ways: the librarian writes only patch.yaml, which the pen applies; the curator writes a verdict directly; ktl-prose rewords; the KTL Registrar plugin writes a related block. The docent does not write in the bundle; knowledge-feedback.sh records a reader's entry in feedback.md. The gate checks each pull request, and the report computes every label on each read."
    },
